Program          : DRVEC 0.12
Input Data File  : the .pre files
Output File      : dgatepq.out
Model            : VARMA-VECM(2,1), M = 2 series, cointegration rank r = 0
Estimation       : Exact Unconditional Maximum Likelihood, Algorithm AS 311 (Mauricio 1997), xi sequence truncated at 1e-3
Transformation   : VECM to stationary VARMA (Mauricio 2006)
Deterministic    : case 3 -- E[nabla Y2] free, E[W] free (drifts as in the .pre files)
Structure        : F diagonal, Theta diagonal (-diagma), Sigma diagonal
Series           : muskrat mink   (2 in the nabla Y2 block, 0 in Y1)
Sample           : 61 observations from 1851, annual (raw 62)

Search: 2 starting points, 2 converged; logL from -34.627186 to -34.627186.  The best is `seed'.
  start        logL            stop  iters  admissible start
  seed            -34.627186     grad     23  as given
  nested          -34.627186     grad     18  as given
  The SPREAD is the diagnostic: on a well-behaved surface every start lands in the same place.

