=============================================================
  Estimated Parameters and Standard Deviations
=============================================================

  Gamma(L) (nabla Y_t - delta) = alpha (beta'Y_{t-1} - E[W]) + Theta(L) A_t,  delta = E[nabla Y]
  with Pi = alpha beta' of rank r, and beta = [I_r ; beta_2] normalised on Y1.
  Johansen's notation throughout: a NEGATIVE alpha is error-correcting.
  Rows read `equation <- regressor`; D.x is nabla x, A.x its innovation,
  and ec1..ec%d are the equilibrium errors beta'Y_{t-1}.

